<p id="mwA0w">The five "double flat" notes and five "double sharp" notes may be replaced by half sharps and half flats, similar to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quarter_tone" title="Quarter tone" id="mwA00">quarter tone</a> system:</p>

