<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turkish_makam" title="Turkish makam">Turkish makam</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mugham" title="Mugham">Mugham</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muqam" title="Muqam">Muqam</a></li></ul></li>
